{"id":"630c319f5a2106ce","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md","title":"Complex Banach Algebra","display":"df-banach-algebra — Complex Banach Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-banach-algebra","aliases":["58-df-banach-algebra","Banach Algebra","58-df-zfc-analysis2-banach-algebra"],"display":"df-banach-algebra — Complex Banach Algebra","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-banach-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-banach-algebra</span><span>Banach Algebra</span><span>58-df-zfc-analysis2-banach-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-banach-algebra — Complex Banach Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef59807ad934771f\" href=\"?note=ef59807ad934771f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md\">../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A\\in V\">\\(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Banach}_S(A,\\mathbb C,+_A,\\odot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Banach}_S(A,\\mathbb C,+_A,\\odot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\\)</span> is the fully parameterized Banach-space predicate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2BanachAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2BanachAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}banach\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Banach}_S(A,\\mathbb C,+_A,\\odot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\cdot_A,A\\times A,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\;((a\\cdot_A b)\\cdot_A c=a\\cdot_A(b\\cdot_A c))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\;\\bigl(a\\cdot_A(b+_A c)=a\\cdot_A b+_A a\\cdot_A c\\land(a+_A b)\\cdot_A c=a\\cdot_A c+_A b\\cdot_A c\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\bigl((\\alpha\\odot_A a)\\cdot_A b=\\alpha\\odot_A(a\\cdot_A b)\\land a\\cdot_A(\\alpha\\odot_A b)=\\alpha\\odot_A(a\\cdot_A b)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(\\|a\\cdot_A b\\|_A\\leq\\|a\\|_A\\,\\|b\\|_A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}banach\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Banach}_S(A,\\mathbb C,+_A,\\odot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\cdot_A,A\\times A,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\;((a\\cdot_A b)\\cdot_A c=a\\cdot_A(b\\cdot_A c))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\;\\bigl(a\\cdot_A(b+_A c)=a\\cdot_A b+_A a\\cdot_A c\\land(a+_A b)\\cdot_A c=a\\cdot_A c+_A b\\cdot_A c\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\bigl((\\alpha\\odot_A a)\\cdot_A b=\\alpha\\odot_A(a\\cdot_A b)\\land a\\cdot_A(\\alpha\\odot_A b)=\\alpha\\odot_A(a\\cdot_A b)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(\\|a\\cdot_A b\\|_A\\leq\\|a\\|_A\\,\\|b\\|_A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}banach\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}projection}\\vdash\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S(A,+_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\odot_A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}banach\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}projection}\\vdash\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S(A,+_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\odot_A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}banach\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2BanachAlgebra}_S(A,+_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S(A,+_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}banach\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2BanachAlgebra}_S(A,+_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S(A,+_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The scalar action is explicit in the core predicate, so multiplication and completeness use the same complex vector-space structure.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-analysis2-banach-algebra</code> is merged here.</li>\n<li>Commutative: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\hat{a}\\hat{b} = \\widehat{ab}\">\\(\\hat{a}\\hat{b} = \\widehat{ab}\\)</span></li>\n<li>Examples: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(K)\">\\(C(K)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^\\infty\">\\(L^\\infty\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{B}(H)\">\\(\\mathcal{B}(H)\\)</span></li>\n<li>Spectral radius: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r(a) = \\lim_n \\|a^n\\|^{1/n} = \\max |\\sigma(a)|\">\\(r(a) = \\lim_n \\|a^n\\|^{1/n} = \\max |\\sigma(a)|\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Functional Analysis</li>\n<li>Conway, A Course in Functional Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef59807ad934771f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Banach}_S(A,\\mathbb C,+_A,\\odot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2BanachAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}banach\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Banach}_S(A,\\mathbb C,+_A,\\odot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\cdot_A,A\\times A,A)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\;((a\\cdot_A b)\\cdot_A c=a\\cdot_A(b\\cdot_A c))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\;\\bigl(a\\cdot_A(b+_A c)=a\\cdot_A b+_A a\\cdot_A c\\land(a+_A b)\\cdot_A c=a\\cdot_A c+_A b\\cdot_A c\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\bigl((\\alpha\\odot_A a)\\cdot_A b=\\alpha\\odot_A(a\\cdot_A b)\\land a\\cdot_A(\\alpha\\odot_A b)=\\alpha\\odot_A(a\\cdot_A b)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(\\|a\\cdot_A b\\|_A\\leq\\|a\\|_A\\,\\|b\\|_A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}banach\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}projection}\\vdash\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S(A,+_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\odot_A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}banach\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2BanachAlgebra}_S(A,+_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S(A,+_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\hat{a}\\hat{b} = \\widehat{ab}","display":false},{"tex":"C(K)","display":false},{"tex":"L^\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{B}(H)","display":false},{"tex":"r(a) = \\lim_n \\|a^n\\|^{1/n} = \\max |\\sigma(a)|","display":false}],"bytes":2330,"backlinks":[{"id":"1f2a9a9bf39ac82d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md]])"},{"id":"051b1a34c565ddef","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md]])"},{"id":"83c37bed44770f30","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S$ (全参数复 Banach 代数谓词, see [[../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md]])"},{"id":"82a3b4cc2d3373ec","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\cdot_A,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)$ (see [[58-df-banach-algebra]])"},{"id":"7745e9d0f7bd7f8e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md]])."},{"id":"59c5498c726aa6df","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)$ (complex Banach algebra, see [[58-df-banach-algebra]])"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-235","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-banach-algebra]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-168","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md|58-df-banach-algebra]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["ef59807ad934771f","36d7463d215be751"]}